  "proof": "Package and host regression tests cover data validation, literal Unicode insertion, cursor position, deletion, mode return and distinct system switching; app/extension and independent-consumer builds establish linkage. Normal Simulator proof must establish the actual extension smiley journey on compact and docked layouts. Exact-head independent review must inspect these boundaries and this assessment.",
